USAGE :
  java Main testfile
  java Main trainfdata testfile

Compile:
  ./compile.sh

Notes:
  We assume the first column of testdata to be id and the first row to have attribute's name.
  filetest1 is the example input of restaurant.csv
  filetest2 is the example input of weather.csv
  
  
Examples:
  java Main data/restaurant.csv testfile1
  java Main data/weather.csv testfile2



